{"title":"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For how many values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is it true that the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/c/c1cdf83c4c53813a13d6bf988adc75324dd592e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x + a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" /> passes through the\nvertex of the parabola <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/3/443aab784cff95bb42acac4009ab9720e1f124c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x^2 + a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" />&#160;?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/2/012afc0b1124a8457fd92672279ede9dc1502502.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 0      \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 1      \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 2      \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 10      \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\text{infinitely many}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"451\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see that the vertex of the quadratic function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/3/443aab784cff95bb42acac4009ab9720e1f124c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x^2 + a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/7/a7753001ea3b7f81400243625b2f02393f2197f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,\\,a^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"53\" height=\"21\" />. The y-intercept of the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/c/c1cdf83c4c53813a13d6bf988adc75324dd592e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x + a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/e/c7efd24ee4de34ddf50b7bccee0c34bb64c84184.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,\\,a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"18\" />. We want to find the values (if any) such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/b/21bd58db7946cda28211b736757823e39970ab01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=a^2$\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />. Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, the only values that satisfy this are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a80a017b801a20695c89976eb9f60cfc8a62a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"53\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B\">2005 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Pr